 "statement": "For every curve coefficient pair [def-weil-pbc-curve-setting] $(C,F)$ with $C$\nproper over $k$: for every algebraically closed extension $k'/k$ and every\ninteger $q\\geq0$, the pullback map [def-weil-pbc-extension-pullback]\n$\\rho^q_{k'/k}(C,F)$ is an isomorphism, without a restriction on the torsion\nof $F$.",
